    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1350">

                <pb facs="1283" n="1117" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg1117"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/888</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Jefferson to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-05T10:00:00-05:45">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 5, 1917, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s February 1, 4 p.m. Have addressed note to Minister for Foreign
                    Affairs informing the Nicaraguan Government that the sum of 250,000 dollars will
                    be deposited to its order.</p>
                <p>Please indicate on what bank the drafts are to be drawn for this amount. Reply
                    requested at once.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jefferson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
